'''Casual Duel Cup''' is a 1on1 non-eliminating tournament meant for rookies and low/mid-skilled players. One can think of it as the Duel Edition of [[QuakeWorld MIX League]].

Signups are to be approved by the admin - we want to limit the tournament to lower-skilled players, coming mostly from the QML ranks.

A non-eliminating tournament structure ([https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swiss-system_tournament Swiss]) will be used. This means everyone gets to play the same amount of matches, even if one loses all their matches. If the number of players in a round is not even, a bye will be awarded. 4 or 5 rounds of matches will be played, until we have a clear winner (only one player with 4-0 or 5-0), with a pace of about one match per week.

All matches are Best of 5 (BO5).

== Format ==
* '''Non-Eliminating''' Swiss-system tournament format
* All matches are BO5.
* 4 or 5 rounds of matches, 1 match per week.
* No divisions, no regions.
* First round of pairings will be posted on the 1st of March!

